{
  "_comment": [
    "Registry of every Shopify preset store the suite runs against.",
    "Each entry becomes a Playwright project group (setup + desktop/tablet/mobile).",
    "Per-preset overrides are read from the environment at load time:",
    "  PRESET_<KEY>_URL       overrides 'url'      (KEY uppercased, '-' -> '_')",
    "  PRESET_<KEY>_PASSWORD  overrides 'password'",
    "  STOREFRONT_PASSWORD    fallback password for every preset",
    "A null expectation means 'not applicable to this preset' and the matching",
    "test skips with an annotation instead of failing (degrade-don't-fail).",
    "All values below were verified against the live storefronts."
  ],
